    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Daying Ering is widely regarded as the architect of modern Arunachal Pradesh politics and chaired the influential Ering Committee in 1965.",
        "Mamang Dai and Yeshe Dorjee Thongchi are celebrated literary figures who brought national recognition to the state through the Sahitya Akademi Award.",
        "Tapi Mra created history as the first person from Arunachal Pradesh to conquer Mount Everest.",
        "Anshu Jamsenpa holds the world record for the fastest dual ascent of Mount Everest by a female climber."
      ],
